}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Sproink icon0}}
| desc = Leaps backward, dodges incoming projectiles, and launches an Impetus attack on the 2 furthest enemy units within Enchantress' attack range + 100.
}}
* Directly uses {{A|Enchantress|Impetus}}'s ability values, it does nothing if Impetus is not learned upon cast.

* For {{M|melee}} units, if the enemy target is {{G|melee miss range}} range farther than the attacker's range, the attack will {{M|miss}} regardless.

