{{Draftnotes
| name = Little Friends
| desc = Requires drafting {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{A|Enchantress|Enchant}} to unlock this ability.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Little Friends icon0}}
| desc = Enchantress roots an enemy unit. All creeps, ally, enemy and neutral within a radius will gain bonus movement and attack speed and attack the chosen target for 6 seconds.
}}
* The max root duration requires {{#expr:({{#var:Little Friends value4}}-{{#var:Little Friends value2}})/{{#var:Little Friends value3}}}} valid creeps have to be within the radius upon cast.

* {{Symbol|Taunt}}
** Creates a negative {{M|aura}} that applies the [[taunt]] component with an infinite linger duration.
** The {{M|debuff}} {{M|dispels}} in the following conditions:
*** When the debuff on the primary target expires.
*** Upon the affected enemy's {{M|death}}.
** The kill credit is still given to Enchantress if the creep's attack {{M|projectile}} lands the kill upon the ability's duration expiring.

